WEBVTT

00:09.034 --> 00:10.137
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.241 --> 00:11.931
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.034 --> 00:13.137
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.241 --> 00:15.586
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.689 --> 00:17.724
♪ Ooh!
♪ 哦！

00:17.827 --> 00:20.206
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.310 --> 00:22.000
♪ Spongebob Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.103 --> 00:23.965
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.068 --> 00:25.724
♪ Spongebob
Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤！ ♪

00:25.827 --> 00:28.241
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.344 --> 00:29.724
♪ Spongebob Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:29.827 --> 00:31.896
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.000 --> 00:34.206
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!♪ready?
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪ 准备好了吗？

00:34.310 --> 00:36.206
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.310 --> 00:38.620
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.724 --> 00:40.172
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.275 --> 00:43.965
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:50.655 --> 00:56.103
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:56.206 --> 01:00.379
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:07.655 --> 01:08.827
Come on, Mr. Doodles
来吧，涂鸦先生

01:08.931 --> 01:10.137
we haven't got all day.
我们没有一整天的时间。

01:10.241 --> 01:12.517
We got to down
to me favorite restaurant...
我们得下来
对我来说最喜欢的餐厅...

01:12.620 --> 01:15.517
Mine... where we're shooting
our first ever
我的...我们拍摄的地方
我们的第一次

01:15.620 --> 01:16.862
Krusty Krab commercial.
蟹堡王广告。

01:16.965 --> 01:18.206
After this commercial airs
这段广告播出后

01:18.310 --> 01:20.172
we'll be swarming
with customers.
我们将会蜂拥而至
与客户。

01:20.275 --> 01:23.068
I can already feel myself
sweating money.
我已经能感觉到自己
流汗钱。

01:24.551 --> 01:27.793
No, I got Squidward
organizing the whole thing.
不，我有章鱼哥
组织整个事情。

01:27.896 --> 01:29.758
He's, you know... artsy.
他，你知道……很有艺术气息。

01:29.862 --> 01:30.689
What the...?
什么……？

01:30.793 --> 01:32.724
This looks expensive.
这看起来很贵。

01:32.827 --> 01:35.206
Out of my way.
Coming through.
别挡我的路。
即将通过。

01:35.310 --> 01:37.275
Move it or lose it.
移动它或丢失它。

01:37.379 --> 01:38.379
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

01:38.448 --> 01:39.517
What?
什么？

01:39.620 --> 01:41.034
What in the toons'
name is going on?
卡通里有什么
名字是怎么回事？

01:41.137 --> 01:43.448
We're making the commercial,
Mr. Krabs.
我们正在制作广告，
蟹老板。

01:43.551 --> 01:47.034
What you're doing
is throwing away me money.
你在做什么
正在扔掉我的钱。

01:47.137 --> 01:48.379
I told you to rent
我告诉过你去租房子

01:48.482 --> 01:50.793
only what's
absolutely necessary.
只是什么
绝对有必要。

01:50.896 --> 01:52.000
This is all necessary.
这都是必要的。

01:52.103 --> 01:54.551
We'll, what's all
this useless junk?
我们会，这一切都是什么
这个无用的垃圾？

01:54.655 --> 01:56.931
That's the useless junk
for scene 28.
这就是无用的垃圾
对于场景 28。

01:57.034 --> 01:59.172
Oh, well, how do you
explain that?
哦，好吧，你怎么样
解释一下？

01:59.275 --> 02:01.068
A second Krusty Krab?
第二个蟹堡王？

02:01.172 --> 02:04.862
Mr. Krabs, everyone
needs an understudy.
蟹老板，大家好
需要一名替补。

02:04.965 --> 02:06.896
Well, you got me there.
好吧，你让我到了那里。

02:07.000 --> 02:08.586
But why do we need him?
但我们为什么需要他呢？

02:08.689 --> 02:11.758
This job gets
very stressful, Mr. Krabs.
这份工作得到
蟹老板，压力很大。

02:11.862 --> 02:13.551
All right, get lost, all of you!
好吧，你们都滚蛋吧！

02:13.655 --> 02:18.103
You're fired! Go on! Scram!
Get out of here, you moochers.
你被解雇了！继续！滚！
滚出去吧，你们这些混蛋。

02:18.206 --> 02:19.862
That's right, keep moving!
没错，继续前进！

02:21.137 --> 02:22.137
Except you. You stay.
除了你。你留下来。

02:23.413 --> 02:24.827
Well, this is just great.
嗯，这太棒了。

02:24.931 --> 02:27.275
Now we've got no crew
to make the commercial.
现在我们已经没有船员了
制作广告。

02:27.379 --> 02:29.620
What are you talking
about, Squidward?
你在说什么
关于，章鱼哥？

02:29.724 --> 02:32.586
We got the cheapest
crew in the world.
我们买的是最便宜的
世界上的船员。

02:32.689 --> 02:33.793
You, me and Spongebob.
你、我和海绵宝宝。

02:33.896 --> 02:37.103
Speaking of which, where
is that little barnacle?
说到这里，哪里
那是小藤壶吗？

02:37.206 --> 02:38.586
I'm down here, sir.
我在这儿，先生。

02:38.689 --> 02:39.827
What are you doing, lad?
你在做什么，小伙子？

02:39.931 --> 02:42.793
Squidward said I could help
by burying myself.
章鱼哥说我可以帮忙
通过埋葬我自己。

02:42.896 --> 02:43.724
Quit fooling
别再愚弄了

02:43.827 --> 02:44.965
and come on out.
出来吧。

02:45.068 --> 02:47.103
I need you to be
in the commercial.
我需要你成为
在广告中。

02:47.206 --> 02:50.206
Me? In the Krusty Krab
commercial? Me?
我？在蟹堡里
商业？我？

02:52.137 --> 02:53.413
But-but-but-but-but...
但是但是但是但是但是但是...

02:53.517 --> 02:56.137
Don't throw your buts
at me, Mr. Squidward.
别扔你的屁股
对我，章鱼哥先生。

02:56.241 --> 02:58.000
We got a timetable to keep.
我们有一个时间表要遵守。

02:58.103 --> 02:59.793
This thing airs tonight.
这件事今晚播出。

02:59.896 --> 03:00.896
Tonight?
今晚？

03:00.965 --> 03:01.827
Tonight?
今晚？

03:01.931 --> 03:03.068
Yep. I got a sweet deal
是的。我得到了一笔甜蜜的交易

03:03.172 --> 03:05.275
on a prime-time slot.
在黄金时段。

03:07.137 --> 03:08.931
It's almost on, Gary.
快要开始了，加里。

03:10.862 --> 03:12.103
Yeah, I got butterflies, too.
是的，我也有蝴蝶。

03:12.206 --> 03:14.965
This is the most exciting thing
to ever happen
这是最令人兴奋的事情
永远发生

03:15.068 --> 03:16.310
in the history of history.
在历史的历史中。

03:16.413 --> 03:18.517
Look, Gary, it's on!
看，加里，它开始了！

03:18.620 --> 03:21.172
Oh, Jen, I've got
a real problem.
哦，珍，我有
一个真正的问题。

03:21.275 --> 03:23.344
What's your problem, Amy?
你有什么问题吗，艾米？

03:23.448 --> 03:25.000
I've got all this money
我有这么多钱

03:25.103 --> 03:28.137
and I don't know
what to do with it
我不知道
该怎么办

03:28.241 --> 03:29.241
and I'm hungry.
我饿了。

03:31.000 --> 03:32.103
Who's there?
谁在那里？

03:32.206 --> 03:35.068
Where's that coming from?
那是从哪里来的？

03:35.172 --> 03:38.068
Yippee! It's Mr. Krabs.
耶皮！是蟹老板。

03:38.172 --> 03:39.758
That's right, Amy.
没错，艾米。

03:39.862 --> 03:43.137
I heard all about your little
problem and I'm here to help.
我听说了你的小事
问题，我是来帮忙的。

03:43.241 --> 03:46.000
Follow me!
跟我来！

03:46.103 --> 03:48.206
Where are we? Where are we?
我们在哪里？我们在哪里？

03:48.310 --> 03:50.206
Why, we're at none other than...
为什么，我们只是在...

03:50.310 --> 03:52.034
The Krusty Krab.
蟹堡王。

03:52.137 --> 03:53.034
Did you say
你说

03:53.137 --> 03:54.517
Krusty Krab?
蟹堡王？

03:54.620 --> 03:55.931
That's right.
这是正确的。

03:56.034 --> 03:57.068
Krusty Krab.
蟹堡王。

03:57.172 --> 03:59.655
Home of the world famous...
世界著名的故乡...

03:59.758 --> 04:01.379
Krabby Patty!
蟹蟹帕蒂！

04:01.482 --> 04:03.655
What's a Krabby Patty?
什么是蟹黄饼？

04:05.275 --> 04:07.206
Why, it's only the most
mouth-watering
为什么，这只是最
令人垂涎欲滴

04:07.310 --> 04:08.724
appetizing food
in the seven seas.
开胃的食物
在七大洋中。

04:09.827 --> 04:10.827
There I am, Gary!
我在那里，加里！

04:10.896 --> 04:12.275
There I am!
我在那里！

04:12.379 --> 04:14.379
We start with a fresh
patty... grilled and juicy.
我们从新鲜开始
肉饼……烤得多汁。

04:14.482 --> 04:17.241
Add some crisp undersea
veggies and cheese.
添加一些清爽的海底
蔬菜和奶酪。

04:17.344 --> 04:20.000
Topped off with secret sauce
and some buns.
淋上秘制酱汁即可
和一些面包。

04:20.103 --> 04:23.000
Voila! A Krabby Patty.
瞧！蟹肉饼。

04:23.103 --> 04:26.103
I want a Krabby Patty.
我想要一个蟹肉饼。

04:26.206 --> 04:27.655
Me, too.
我也是。

04:27.758 --> 04:31.551
How are you liking them
Krabby Patties, girls?
你觉得他们怎么样
蟹肉饼，女孩们？

04:33.379 --> 04:36.034
Look, Gary,
there I am again. Look!
看，加里，
我又来了。看！

04:36.137 --> 04:38.206
Two more satisfied customers.
又有两个满意的客户。

04:38.310 --> 04:40.206
So, why don't you come on in
那么，你为什么不进来呢？

04:40.310 --> 04:43.379
and have yourself
a Krabby Patty today?
并拥有自己
今天吃蟹肉饼吗？

04:43.482 --> 04:45.137
♪ The Krusty Krab
♪ 蟹堡王

04:45.241 --> 04:47.620
♪ Come spend your money here!
♪ 来这里花钱吧！

04:47.724 --> 04:51.965
That was the best 60 seconds
of my life.
那是最好的60秒
我的生活。

04:52.068 --> 04:54.379
Well, time for bed.
好了，该睡觉了。

04:59.103 --> 05:03.103
Time to go do my favorite thing
at my favorite place.
是时候去做我最喜欢的事情了
在我最喜欢的地方。

05:08.172 --> 05:09.344
Hey, you!
嘿，你！

05:09.448 --> 05:11.241
Top of the morning, Oldster.
早上起来，老头。

05:11.344 --> 05:13.931
Hey, I saw you on TV last night.
嘿，我昨晚在电视上看到你了。

05:14.034 --> 05:16.103
New Bran Flakes.
新麸皮片。

05:16.206 --> 05:17.758
Bold new taste.
大胆的新口味。

05:17.862 --> 05:19.931
Bran Flakes.
麸皮片。

05:20.034 --> 05:21.034
You did?
你做到了吗？

05:21.103 --> 05:24.000
Yeah, you were on a commercial.
是的，你在拍广告。

05:24.103 --> 05:25.172
You're right.
你说得对。

05:25.275 --> 05:27.344
Wow, he recognized me.
哇，他认出了我。

05:27.448 --> 05:30.103
Yep. See you later, Bran Flakes.
是的。稍后见，麸片。

05:30.206 --> 05:31.620
What a nice cereal box.
多么漂亮的麦片盒啊。

05:31.724 --> 05:36.034
Ah... "Weren't you
that guy on TV?"
啊……“你不是吗？
电视里那个人？”

05:36.137 --> 05:38.103
"Yes, I am that guy.
“是的，我就是那个人。

05:38.206 --> 05:40.827
How kind of you to notice."
你能注意到真是太好了。”

05:40.931 --> 05:45.620
"Weren't you that guy
on the television last night?"
“你不是那个人吗
昨晚在电视上吗？”

05:47.034 --> 05:49.137
"Yes, that was me. I..."
“是的，那就是我。我……”

05:49.241 --> 05:51.034
Oh, please excuse me, sir.
哦，请原谅，先生。

05:51.137 --> 05:52.965
Oh, that's quite all right
哦，那完全没问题

05:53.068 --> 05:54.172
uh... "Spongebob."
呃……“海绵宝宝。”

05:54.275 --> 05:56.793
Wow. I'm getting
recognized all over.
哇。我得到了
浑身都被认可了。

05:56.896 --> 05:58.103
Next thing you know
接下来你知道的事情

05:58.206 --> 05:59.965
people are going to
start doing stuff
人们将会去
开始做事

06:00.068 --> 06:02.103
like holding doors open for...
就像为……打开门一样

06:02.206 --> 06:03.275
Why, sir, I'm flattered.
为什么，先生，我受宠若惊。

06:03.379 --> 06:05.206
Really? I don't smell anything.
真的吗？我什么也没闻到。

06:06.344 --> 06:08.758
You're on your way, kid.
你正在路上，孩子。

06:09.931 --> 06:10.931
Excuse me, sir.
对不起，先生。

06:10.965 --> 06:12.413
Could I get a napkin?
我可以拿张餐巾纸吗？

06:12.517 --> 06:13.827
Why, of course, dear sir.
为什么，当然，亲爱的先生。

06:13.931 --> 06:16.379
And next time, feel free
to approach me.
下次，请随意
来接近我。

06:16.482 --> 06:20.965
It must be so degrading
to ask from across the room.
一定是这么丢脸
从房间的另一边询问。

06:21.758 --> 06:24.172
And who am I making
this bad boy out to?
而我又在造谁
这个坏小子出来了？

06:24.275 --> 06:26.310
To my tail fin.
到我的尾鳍。

06:26.413 --> 06:28.275
I'll get it myself.
我自己去拿。

06:28.379 --> 06:31.034
F-I-N. There we are, darling.
鳍。我们到了，亲爱的。

06:31.137 --> 06:34.172
Mmm? Shyness got
the best of him.
嗯？害羞了
最好的他。

06:34.275 --> 06:35.827
There you are, Spongebob.
你在这里，海绵宝宝。

06:35.931 --> 06:36.551
I need you to...
我需要你...

06:36.655 --> 06:37.655
No problem, Squidward.
没问题，章鱼哥。

06:37.758 --> 06:39.931
I got one already made out.
我已经做好了一份。

06:40.034 --> 06:41.103
Enjoy.
享受。

06:42.275 --> 06:44.517
"To my tail fin."
“到我的尾鳍。”

06:46.000 --> 06:48.344
Yes, I am that guy on TV.
是的，我就是电视上的那个人。

06:48.448 --> 06:49.586
Hey, look.
嘿，看。

06:49.689 --> 06:52.275
Please, good people,
no photos at work.
请各位好心人，
工作时没有照片。

06:52.379 --> 06:53.482
Here's the ketchup.
这是番茄酱。

06:53.586 --> 06:55.137
Well, maybe just one.
嗯，也许只有一个。

06:55.241 --> 06:56.344
Another one?
另一个？

06:56.448 --> 06:57.931
Okay. Limbo.
好的。地狱边境。

06:59.275 --> 07:00.413
And now the... oh, I got it.
现在……哦，我明白了。

07:00.517 --> 07:02.241
There you are, Spongebob.
你在这里，海绵宝宝。

07:02.344 --> 07:03.103
Jet pilot.
喷气机飞行员。

07:03.206 --> 07:05.034
Now I need you to... ow!
现在我需要你...噢！

07:07.068 --> 07:07.827
All right, boy.
好吧，孩子。

07:07.931 --> 07:10.275
Get in there and scrub the head
进去擦洗头部

07:10.379 --> 07:13.103
and stop acting so predictable.
并停止表现得如此可预测。

07:13.206 --> 07:16.103
So misunderstood.
所以被误解了。

07:16.862 --> 07:21.413
Alas, good people, even the
brightest of stars grow weary.
唉，好人，连
最亮的星星也会变得疲倦。

07:21.517 --> 07:23.034
And I am no exception.
我也不例外。

07:23.137 --> 07:27.275
But I will shine again after
a quick break in my quarters.
但之后我会再次闪耀
在我的宿舍里短暂休息一下。

07:27.379 --> 07:28.862
Stay beautiful.
保持美丽。

07:29.206 --> 07:31.724
Hey, were you able to
catch Glandy McPinkfish
嘿，你能做到吗？
捕捉格兰迪麦克粉鱼

07:31.827 --> 07:33.517
on Floundermanlast night?
昨晚在比目鱼？

07:33.620 --> 07:34.827
No, how was he?
不，他怎么样？

07:34.931 --> 07:36.411
Well, I new this guy's
acting was good
好吧，我新认识了这个人
演技很好

07:36.482 --> 07:38.344
but his singing is phenomenal.
但他的歌声非常出色。

07:38.448 --> 07:39.620
I'm tell you, Vender
我告诉你，卖家

07:39.724 --> 07:42.241
if that guy was to cut
a solo record
如果那个人要砍的话
独奏唱片

07:42.344 --> 07:43.965
it would be a hit.
这会很受欢迎。

07:45.241 --> 07:47.862
Solo record.
独奏唱片。

07:48.344 --> 07:52.310
So, if I fire him and make his
successor do twice the work...
所以，如果我解雇他并让他
继任者做双倍的工作...

07:53.965 --> 07:55.206
Uh, come in.
呃，进来吧。

07:55.310 --> 07:57.103
Oh, it's just you, Spongebob.
噢，只有你，海绵宝宝。

07:57.206 --> 07:58.896
Those heads better be beautiful.
那些头最好漂亮一些。

07:59.000 --> 08:00.827
They are, Mr. Krabs,
and so is mine.
他们是，蟹老板先生，
我的也是。

08:00.931 --> 08:04.172
And now I got to lay something
on you, Krabs baby.
现在我必须放下一些东西
就在你身上，蟹蟹宝贝。

08:04.275 --> 08:05.482
The only thing you better lay
唯一你最好躺下的东西

08:05.586 --> 08:08.137
is some patties on
the grill, fry boy.
上面有一些肉饼吗
烤架，油炸男孩。

08:08.241 --> 08:09.655
I can't take that gig, Krabber.
我不能接受那个演出，克拉伯。

08:09.758 --> 08:11.620
That phase of my career is over.
我职业生涯的那个阶段已经结束了。

08:11.724 --> 08:12.862
I'm an entertainer now.
我现在是一名艺人。

08:12.965 --> 08:14.405
What in blazes
are you talking about?
大火中的什么
你在说什么？

08:14.482 --> 08:18.310
Come on, Krabs, let's think
outside the box for a second.
来吧，蟹蟹，我们来想一想
在盒子外面呆一秒钟。

08:18.413 --> 08:19.620
Commercials are old hat.
广告已经过时了。

08:19.724 --> 08:20.896
The people want music.
人们想要音乐。

08:21.000 --> 08:22.600
If I could change fate,
I would, Krabsie.
如果我能改变命运
我愿意，克拉布西。

08:22.689 --> 08:25.586
But I'm an entertainer
deep down... a people's person.
但我是一个艺人
在内心深处……一个人民的人。

08:25.689 --> 08:27.551
We're on the same page here,
aren't we?
我们在同一页上，
我们不是吗？

08:27.655 --> 08:31.068
Boy, those krabby fumes
must have got to your head.
男孩，那些螃蟹味
一定已经让你心烦意乱了。

08:31.172 --> 08:35.689
Borrow Squidward's gas mask
then get right back to work.
借用章鱼哥的防毒面具
然后立即回去工作。

08:35.793 --> 08:37.689
I knew you'd understand.
我就知道你会理解的。

08:37.793 --> 08:40.000
Well, thanks for the start.
嗯，谢谢你的开始。

08:40.103 --> 08:41.413
I'm out of here.
我要离开这里了

08:44.310 --> 08:49.275
Ooh... I've never felt
such a strange combination
哦...我从来没有感觉过
如此奇怪的组合

08:49.379 --> 08:51.931
of pity and indigestion.
怜悯和消化不良。

08:52.034 --> 08:53.206
There he is.
他就在那里。

08:53.310 --> 08:55.310
Hey, we've been waiting for you.
嘿，我们一直在等你。

08:55.413 --> 08:57.310
Where have you been?
你去哪儿了？

08:57.689 --> 08:59.896
How long are you going
to keep us standing here?
你要去多久
让我们站在这里？

09:00.000 --> 09:03.172
Well, Spongebob, are you
just going to stand there
那么，海绵宝宝，你是吗？
只是要站在那里

09:03.275 --> 09:04.517
like a half-wit, mouth agape
像个傻子，张着嘴

09:04.620 --> 09:07.241
or are you going to fill
these people's orders?
或者你要填补
这些人的命令？

09:07.344 --> 09:08.379
Pipe down, Squidward.
下来，章鱼哥。

09:08.482 --> 09:09.482
This crowd looks angry.
这群人看起来很生气。

09:09.586 --> 09:11.275
They're not going
to wait any longer.
他们不会去
再等一下。

09:11.379 --> 09:15.344
I think I better give them
what they need and fast.
我想我最好给他们
他们需要什么并且快速。

09:15.448 --> 09:16.275
I think so, too
我也这么认为

09:16.379 --> 09:17.793
or Krabs will fire both of us.
否则螃蟹会解雇我们俩。

09:17.896 --> 09:20.689
On second thought,
keep them waiting.
再一想，
让他们等待。

09:20.793 --> 09:21.896
No can do, Squidward.
没办法，章鱼哥。

09:22.000 --> 09:23.551
These people demand
entertainment.
这些人要求
娱乐。

09:23.655 --> 09:24.655
Enter what?
输入什么？

09:24.724 --> 09:27.034
How you doing, folks?
各位，你们好吗？

09:27.137 --> 09:28.000
Hungry!
饥饿的！

09:28.103 --> 09:30.206
That's no problem,
ladies and germs
那没问题，
女士们和细菌

09:30.310 --> 09:31.551
'cause Spongebob is here
因为海绵宝宝在这里

09:31.655 --> 09:33.379
to satisfy.
满足。

09:33.482 --> 09:34.379
Hey.
嘿。

09:34.482 --> 09:36.275
Eating here was your idea.
在这里吃饭是你的主意。

09:36.379 --> 09:40.517
I'd like to call this little
number "Striped Sweater."
我想称呼这个小
编号“条纹毛衣”。

09:40.620 --> 09:45.172
♪ The best time to wear
a striped sweater ♪
♪ 最佳佩戴时间
条纹毛衣♪

09:45.275 --> 09:47.965
♪ Is all the time
♪ 一直都是

09:48.068 --> 09:52.689
♪ One with a collar,
turtleneck ♪
♪ 有领子的，
高领衫 ♪

09:52.793 --> 09:54.793
♪ That's the kind
♪ 就是这样的

09:54.896 --> 09:57.448
♪ 'Cause when
you're wearing... ♪
♪ 因为当
你穿着……♪

09:57.551 --> 09:58.551
We're starving!
我们快饿死了！

09:59.896 --> 10:02.620
♪ That one...
special sweater... ♪
♪ 那个...
特别的毛衣...♪

10:04.379 --> 10:06.206
Squidward, this crowd
is insatiable.
章鱼哥，这群人
是不知足的。

10:06.310 --> 10:08.896
Then why don't you
get back in the kitchen
那你为什么不
回到厨房

10:09.000 --> 10:11.482
and grab some patties,
and give them
并抓起一些肉饼，
并给他们

10:11.586 --> 10:13.379
what they came here for!
他们来这里干什么！

10:13.482 --> 10:15.379
Juggling! Thanks, Squiddy.
戏法！谢谢，乌贼。

10:15.482 --> 10:16.344
Boo!
嘘！

10:16.448 --> 10:17.827
Is this some kind of joke?
这是某种玩笑吗？

10:17.931 --> 10:21.310
They want juggling and jokes
at the same time?
他们想要杂耍和笑话
同时？

10:21.413 --> 10:22.931
Tough crowd.
艰难的人群。

10:24.344 --> 10:25.758
Oh, now what's he doing?
哦，现在他在做什么？

10:25.862 --> 10:29.344
Uh, what do you call a vampire
whose car breaks down
呃，你怎么称呼吸血鬼
谁的车坏了

10:29.448 --> 10:31.793
three miles from a blood bank?
距离血库三英里？

10:31.896 --> 10:32.620
A cab.
一辆出租车。

10:32.724 --> 10:34.137
We're losing our appetites!
我们失去了胃口！

10:34.241 --> 10:39.379
Uh, okay, there's a nun,
an astronaut, and a hairdryer.
呃，好吧，有一个修女，
一名宇航员和一个吹风机。

10:39.482 --> 10:41.689
We want patties!
我们要肉饼！

10:41.793 --> 10:44.482
Well, the most I can juggle
is three.
好吧，我最多能兼顾
是三。

10:44.586 --> 10:46.344
But the show must go on.
但演出必须继续下去。

10:46.448 --> 10:47.758
Whoa!
哇！

10:49.862 --> 10:51.206
Boo!
嘘！

10:54.241 --> 10:55.344
Boo!
嘘！

10:57.275 --> 10:58.965
My career is over.
我的职业生涯结束了。

10:59.068 --> 11:01.517
All those years
clawing my way up.
那些年
奋力向上。

11:01.620 --> 11:05.586
All the people
I've stepped on, wasted.
所有的人
我踩了，废了。

11:05.689 --> 11:08.103
Hey, finally.
嘿，终于。

11:08.206 --> 11:11.724
That's what we've been
waiting for.
这就是我们一直以来的样子
等待。

11:12.448 --> 11:15.586
They seem to like it when
I put this patty on the grill.
他们似乎很喜欢当
我把这个肉饼放在烤架上。

11:15.689 --> 11:17.517
I may be able
to save this act yet.
我也许可以
保存这个行为呢。

11:17.620 --> 11:19.241
Roll with it, Spongebob,
roll with it.
跟着它滚吧，海绵宝宝，
与它一起滚动。

11:19.344 --> 11:23.379
There's more where
that came from, folks.
还有更多地方
来自，伙计们。

11:24.586 --> 11:25.620
You like that?
你喜欢这样吗？

11:25.724 --> 11:27.793
It's what we wanted all along.
这就是我们一直想要的。

11:27.896 --> 11:30.413
It's working, but how do I
follow it up?
它正在工作，但我该怎么办
跟进吗？

11:30.517 --> 11:31.793
Think on your feet, Spongebob.
海绵宝宝，冷​​静思考。

11:31.896 --> 11:34.379
That's what got you this far.
Buns!
这就是让你走到这一步的原因。
包子！

11:34.482 --> 11:35.689
It's a stretch
这是一个伸展运动

11:35.793 --> 11:37.310
but we all got to try
但我们都必须尝试

11:37.413 --> 11:40.206
to push the envelope sometime.
有时会挑战极限。

11:41.103 --> 11:45.655
Okay, folks,
how do you like this?
好吧，各位，
你喜欢这个吗？

11:47.241 --> 11:49.310
I'm breaking new ground.
我正在开辟新天地。

11:49.413 --> 11:50.551
Time to get edgy.
是时候变得急躁了。

11:50.655 --> 11:52.931
We want onions!
我们要洋葱！

11:53.034 --> 11:54.275
Cheese!
奶酪！

11:55.655 --> 11:57.965
Ready for the grand finale?
准备好迎接大结局了吗？

12:02.068 --> 12:03.241
Whoopee!
哎哟！

12:03.344 --> 12:05.517
Krabby Patties!
蟹肉饼！

12:09.448 --> 12:11.413
Well, Spongebob, looks like
嗯，海绵宝宝，看起来像

12:11.517 --> 12:14.137
you finally found your calling.
你终于找到了你的使命。

12:14.241 --> 12:15.379
I'll say.
我会说。

12:15.482 --> 12:17.965
I'm so glad I gave up
fry cooking for this.
我很高兴我放弃了
为此炒菜。

12:28.827 --> 12:31.931
Closing time at The Krusty Krab.
The Krusty Krab 的关门时间。

