page 35, section 19,
clause 3a states
第 35 页，第 19 节，
第 3a 条规定

12:49.931 --> 12:51.411
"All staff must remain
on the premises
“所有员工都必须留下来
在该处所

12:51.482 --> 12:54.413
until the day's receipts
are fully accounted for."
直到当天的收据
已全部计算在内。”

12:54.517 --> 12:56.034
But that's not fair.
但这不公平。

12:56.137 --> 12:58.551
Clause 3b:
"The proprietor reserves
the right to be unfair."
第 3b 条：
“业主保留
不公平的权利。”

12:58.655 --> 13:00.137
Teacher's pet.
老师的宠物。

13:00.241 --> 13:01.241
Let's see...
让我们来看看...

13:01.344 --> 13:04.586
five, ten, 25,
blue, applesauce...
五、十、25、
蓝色、苹果酱...

13:04.689 --> 13:06.241
Everything looks to be in order.
一切看起来都井然有序。

13:06.344 --> 13:07.758
Except...
除了...

13:07.862 --> 13:09.034
Where is it?
它在哪里？

13:09.137 --> 13:10.689
Where is it?!
What?
它在哪里？！
什么？

13:10.793 --> 13:13.206
My dime.
Me special dime.
我的一毛钱。
我特别一毛钱。

13:13.310 --> 13:14.758
The first dime I ever made.
我赚到的第一毛钱。

13:14.862 --> 13:17.517
I always keep it
at the back of the
register for luck.
我一直保留着它
在后面
注册以获得好运。

13:17.620 --> 13:19.724
Well, I've never seen it.
嗯，我从来没见过。

13:19.827 --> 13:21.310
Hmm.
唔。

13:21.413 --> 13:24.241
Are you prepared to say that
with your hand on a stack
你准备好这么说了吗
你的手放在一堆

13:24.344 --> 13:26.620
of Interpretive Dance
Quarterlies?
诠释舞蹈
季刊？

13:26.724 --> 13:27.965
Of course I...
我当然...

13:28.068 --> 13:29.586
What are you saying?
你在说什么？

13:29.689 --> 13:32.379
Me? I ain't saying nothing
that would matter to anyone
我？我什么也没说
这对任何人都很重要

13:32.482 --> 13:35.517
who'd be willing to take
a lie detector test.
谁愿意接受
测谎仪测试。

13:35.620 --> 13:37.413
You're saying something.
你在说些什么。

13:37.517 --> 13:38.931
Heavens to Betsy, no.
天哪，贝特西，不。

13:39.034 --> 13:41.620
It's just that me lucky dime's
gone missing
这只是我幸运的一毛钱
失踪了

13:41.724 --> 13:44.793
and you've been working
the register all day.
你一直在工作
一整天都在登记。

13:44.896 --> 13:47.000
Are you accusing me
of something?
你在指责我吗
某事？

13:47.103 --> 13:49.896
Well, the way I see it,
there are three possibilities.
嗯，在我看来，
有三种可能性。

13:50.000 --> 13:52.034
One... you stole it.
一……你偷了它。

13:52.137 --> 13:53.655
Two... you stole it.
二……是你偷的。

13:53.758 --> 13:56.689
Or three... you stole it!
或者三个……你偷了！

13:56.793 --> 13:59.689
I didn't take
your precious dime.
我没拿
你宝贵的一毛钱。

13:59.793 --> 14:01.310
Show me your tentacles.
让我看看你的触手。

14:01.413 --> 14:03.965
What?
I want to see
empty suction cups.
什么？
我想看看
空吸盘。

14:04.068 --> 14:05.655
Here, here, here.
See them?
这里，这里，这里。
看到他们了吗？

14:05.758 --> 14:07.862
You... you can't do that to me.
你……你不能这样对我。

14:07.965 --> 14:09.034
I'm your boss!
我是你的老板！

14:09.137 --> 14:11.724
Not anymore, Mr. Krabs.
不再是了，蟹老板。

14:11.827 --> 14:14.172
I quit.
我不干了。

14:17.655 --> 14:19.551
No.
不。

14:20.551 --> 14:21.827
I'm out of here.
我要离开这里了

14:21.931 --> 14:23.862
Squidward, you're making
a big mistake.
章鱼哥，你在做
一个大错误。

14:23.965 --> 14:25.172
Mistake? Ha!
错误？哈!

14:25.275 --> 14:26.448
The only mistake I ever made
我犯过的唯一错误

14:26.551 --> 14:29.137
was wasting my life
at The Krusty Krab.
在浪费我的生命
在蟹堡王。

14:29.241 --> 14:32.103
But a visit to The Krusty Krab
makes everyone happy.
但是参观蟹堡王
让每个人都高兴。

14:32.206 --> 14:36.862
And what could be better
than serving up smiles?
还有什么可以更好的
而不是微笑？

14:36.965 --> 14:39.241
Being dead or anything else.
死了或者其他什么。

14:39.344 --> 14:41.827
I never knew you felt
so strongly about this.
我从来不知道你的感受
对此如此强烈。

14:41.931 --> 14:43.931
Where have you been?
你去哪儿了？

14:44.034 --> 14:45.689
Well, I guess I can't stop you.
好吧，我想我无法阻止你。

14:45.793 --> 14:49.172
But, Squidward,
it's a cold, cold
world out there.
但是，章鱼哥，
天气很冷，很冷
外面的世界。

14:49.275 --> 14:52.758
No one's going to
serve you happiness
on a silver platter.
没有人会去
为您服务幸福
在银盘上。

14:52.862 --> 14:54.689
Free sample?
Cookies!
免费样品？
曲奇饼！

14:54.793 --> 14:55.655
Can I have...?
我可以有...吗？

14:55.758 --> 14:56.998
Anyway, I just want you to know
无论如何，我只是想让你知道

14:57.068 --> 14:59.724
if you ever get in
trouble, come find me.
如果你进去了
有麻烦就来找我吧。

14:59.827 --> 15:01.724
I'll take care of you.
我会照顾你的。

15:01.827 --> 15:02.827
'Cause you and me?
因为你和我？

15:02.931 --> 15:04.793
We're like brothers.
我们就像兄弟一样。

15:04.896 --> 15:06.620
Only closer.
只能更近一些。

15:10.344 --> 15:12.862
Spongebob, I don't need
your help.
海绵宝宝，我不需要
你的帮助。

15:12.965 --> 15:15.413
I am ready to unlock
my potential.
我准备解锁
我的潜力。

15:15.517 --> 15:18.724
I can become anything
I set my mind to.
我可以成为任何东西
我下定决心。

15:18.827 --> 15:20.793
I could be a football player...
我可以成为一名足球运动员...

15:20.896 --> 15:22.448
or a king...
或者一个国王...

15:22.551 --> 15:23.586
or a spaceman.
或太空人。

15:23.689 --> 15:26.758
Or a football playing
king in space...
或者踢足球
太空之王...

15:26.862 --> 15:27.965
with a mustache.
留着小胡子。

15:28.068 --> 15:30.655
Yeah. Uh-huh.
是的。嗯嗯。

15:30.758 --> 15:32.137
You know, that reminds me
你知道，这让我想起了

15:32.241 --> 15:34.896
there's something I've been
wanting to say to you
我曾经经历过一些事情
想对你说

15:35.000 --> 15:36.827
since the day we met.
自从我们认识的那天起。

15:36.931 --> 15:38.172
Good-bye.
再见。

15:38.275 --> 15:39.586
Next time you see me
下次你见到我时

15:39.689 --> 15:43.793
this town will be eating
out of the palm of my hand.
这个小镇将会吃
从我的手掌中出来。

15:43.896 --> 15:45.827
Spare change?
零钱？

15:45.931 --> 15:47.517
Spare change, ma'am?
女士，有零钱吗？

15:47.620 --> 15:48.655
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

15:48.758 --> 15:50.482
Squidward, is that you?
章鱼哥，是你吗？

15:50.586 --> 15:52.482
Uh, I... uh...
呃，我……呃……

15:52.586 --> 15:53.931
It's me, Spongebob.
是我，海绵宝宝。

15:54.034 --> 15:55.862
We used to work together.
我们曾经一起工作过。

15:55.965 --> 15:57.517
Spongebob?
海绵宝宝？

15:57.620 --> 15:58.448
There you go.
就这样吧。

15:58.551 --> 15:59.827
So where you living these days?
那么你这些天住在哪里？

15:59.931 --> 16:01.965
Squidward
Tentacles?
Yes?
章鱼哥
触手？
是的？

16:02.068 --> 16:04.068
Sign here please.
请在此签名。

16:05.068 --> 16:06.482
Uh... nowhere.
呃……无处可去。

16:06.586 --> 16:08.862
Great, and what have you
been doing with yourself?
太好了，你有什么
自己在做什么？

16:08.965 --> 16:10.103
No, wait, let me guess.
不，等等，让我猜一下。

16:10.206 --> 16:12.724
I see you've been working
on that mustache.
我看到你一直在工作
在那小胡子上。

16:12.827 --> 16:15.137
The tattered clothes...
那些破烂的衣服……

16:15.241 --> 16:16.793
the awful smell...
可怕的气味……

16:16.896 --> 16:18.965
You're a football player! No.
你是一名足球运动员！不。

16:19.068 --> 16:20.655
A spaceman.
一个太空人。

16:20.758 --> 16:21.758
No.
不。

16:21.862 --> 16:22.941
A football playing
king in space?
正在踢足球
太空之王？

16:22.965 --> 16:23.965
Don't you get it?!
你不明白吗？

16:24.068 --> 16:27.000
I'm a loser!
我是一个失败者！

16:27.103 --> 16:29.862
I've lost my job, my home...
我失去了工作，失去了家……

16:29.965 --> 16:32.310
everything!
一切！

16:32.413 --> 16:34.620
Even your paintings?
甚至你的画？

16:34.724 --> 16:38.137
Nobody would take them,
so I had to eat them.
没有人愿意接受他们，
所以我不得不吃它们。

16:45.965 --> 16:47.379
There, there...
那里，那里……

16:47.482 --> 16:49.620
you can come live with me.
你可以来和我一起住。

16:49.724 --> 16:50.862
Here you go, Squidward.
给你，章鱼哥。

16:50.965 --> 16:52.448
You sleep in my bed.
你睡在我床上。

16:52.551 --> 16:55.241
Okay, but just till I get a job.
好吧，但直到我找到工作为止。

16:55.344 --> 16:57.206
One day, two days tops.
一天，两天顶。

16:57.310 --> 17:01.344
Nonsense, you stay as
long as you need to.
废话，你就留下来吧
只要你需要。

17:03.482 --> 17:05.931
Good night, my little angel.
晚安，我的小天使。

17:06.034 --> 17:08.172
Breakfast is ready.
早餐准备好了。

17:08.275 --> 17:10.137
You'll need to build up
your strength again
你需要建立
再次你的力量

17:10.241 --> 17:12.137
so I laid out a big
buffet for you.
所以我布置了一个大
为您准备的自助餐。

17:12.241 --> 17:13.965
And in bed, too?
还有在床上吗？

17:14.068 --> 17:15.655
Oh, thanks, Spongebob.
哦，谢谢，海绵宝宝。

17:15.758 --> 17:18.620
Spongebob, I... Ah, shh, shh, shh.
海绵宝宝，我……啊，嘘，嘘，嘘。

17:18.724 --> 17:20.931
Here comes the plane.
飞机来了。

17:24.517 --> 17:28.000
It's really nice of you
to help me in my time of need.
你真是太好了
在我需要的时候帮助我。

17:28.103 --> 17:30.931
I'll try not to be a burden.
我会努力不成为负担。

17:31.034 --> 17:32.482
It's no trouble.
这不是什么麻烦事。

17:32.586 --> 17:36.344
Is there anything else
I can do for you... winner?
还有什么吗
我能为你做点什么...获胜者？

17:36.448 --> 17:39.620
No, no, no, you've already...
不不不，你已经……

17:39.724 --> 17:41.517
well...
出色地...

18:10.103 --> 18:11.310
Oh, wow.
哦，哇。

18:11.413 --> 18:16.586
Nourishing a broken spirit
is a lot of work.
滋养破碎的心灵
工作量很大。

18:16.689 --> 18:17.482
I'm bushed.
我很忙。

18:17.586 --> 18:20.034
Still, it feels nice to do good.
尽管如此，做好事还是感觉很好。

18:20.137 --> 18:22.172
Good night, Gary.
晚安，加里。

18:22.275 --> 18:23.344
Spongebob
海绵宝宝

18:23.448 --> 18:25.241
can I get a glass of water?
我可以喝杯水吗？

18:27.896 --> 18:29.827
Thank you.
谢谢。

18:29.931 --> 18:30.931
Good night.
晚安。

18:33.310 --> 18:36.344
Spongebob, can I get
some more blankets?
海绵宝宝，我可以得到吗
还要一些毯子吗？

18:39.206 --> 18:40.068
Here you go.
干得好。

18:40.172 --> 18:41.172
Thank you.
谢谢。

18:43.379 --> 18:46.172
Spongebob, you forgot
to turn out the light.
海绵宝宝你忘了
关掉灯。

18:48.103 --> 18:49.103
Good night.
晚安。

18:53.827 --> 18:55.275
Gary.
加里.

18:55.379 --> 18:57.206
Squidward is not a freeloader.
章鱼哥不是贪图便宜的人。

18:57.310 --> 19:00.379
And he would never
take advantage of me.
而他永远不会
利用我。

19:01.137 --> 19:06.931
He's just having a hard time
getting his confidence back.
他只是过得很艰难
恢复他的信心。

19:07.758 --> 19:13.034
I'm sure he's close
to a breakthrough.
我确信他就在附近
达到突破。

19:21.517 --> 19:23.896
I know he still isn't
looking for work!
我知道他仍然不是
找工作！

19:24.000 --> 19:25.000
Don't rub it in!
别把它擦进去！

19:25.068 --> 19:27.827
Spongebob, where's my lemonade?
海绵宝宝，我的柠檬水呢？

19:27.931 --> 19:30.206
Coming, Squidward.
来了，章鱼哥。

19:30.310 --> 19:32.103
Spongebob!
海绵宝宝！

19:32.206 --> 19:34.206
Spongebob!
海绵宝宝！

19:34.310 --> 19:38.344
And why aren't you in uniform?
还有你为什么不穿制服？

19:41.310 --> 19:43.413
It's about time you got here.
你也该到这里了。

19:43.517 --> 19:45.379
Here you go, your majesty.
给您，陛下。

19:45.482 --> 19:47.068
I can't drink that.
我不能喝那个。

19:47.172 --> 19:48.241
Why not?
为什么不呢？

19:48.344 --> 19:50.931
Are you blind?
Just look at it.
你是瞎子吗？
看看它。

19:51.965 --> 19:52.758
What about it?
那又怎样呢？

19:52.862 --> 19:55.310
That lemon has
three seeds in it.
那个柠檬有
里面有三粒种子。

19:55.413 --> 19:56.517
That's an odd number!
这是一个奇数！

19:56.620 --> 19:58.655
I can't eat anything
odd numbered.
我什么都不能吃
奇数。

19:58.758 --> 20:00.655
Fine, I'll just take it out.
好吧，我就把它拿出来。

20:00.758 --> 20:01.793
No! No!
不！不！

20:01.896 --> 20:03.931
It's already contaminated
by the bad lemon.
已经被污染了
坏柠檬。

20:04.034 --> 20:05.482
It won't work.
这是行不通的。

20:05.586 --> 20:10.724
Hmm. That's two things in
this house that won't work.
唔。这是两件事
this house that won't work.

20:10.827 --> 20:13.000
Then go fix them.
然后去修复它们。

20:14.310 --> 20:19.172
Two things that won't work.
有两件事是行不通的。

20:19.275 --> 20:22.172
I've changed my mind.
I want soup instead.
我改变了主意。
我想喝汤。

20:22.275 --> 20:23.275
Okay.
好的。

20:23.310 --> 20:25.620
Don't move.
别动。

20:27.827 --> 20:28.827
Here you go.
干得好。

20:28.931 --> 20:33.551
It's alphabet soup.
I made it special.
这是字母汤。
我把它做得很特别。

20:35.034 --> 20:38.068
Ah! Condensed soup
from a can.
啊!浓缩汤
从一罐。

20:38.172 --> 20:39.344
Disgusting.
恶心。

20:39.448 --> 20:41.206
Now you've ruined my appetite.
现在你毁了我的胃口。

20:41.310 --> 20:43.172
Go fetch me something to read.
去给我拿点东西来读。

20:43.275 --> 20:45.103
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

20:45.206 --> 20:47.034
How about this?
这个怎么样？

20:48.413 --> 20:49.689
Get that away from me.
把它从我身边拿开。

20:49.793 --> 20:51.896
You know I'm allergic
to newsprint.
你知道我过敏
到新闻纸。

20:52.000 --> 20:55.620
You know, when you
swatted that newspaper
out of my hands
你知道，当你
拍打那张报纸
从我手中

20:55.724 --> 20:59.068
it reminded me of something
a friend of mine did...
它让我想起了一件事
我的一个朋友做了...

20:59.172 --> 21:00.344
at his job!
在他的工作中！

21:02.448 --> 21:03.862
4:00. Time for my stories.
4:00。是时候讲我的故事了。

21:03.965 --> 21:08.517
Hurry up, they won't hold
the show while you laze around.
快点，他们撑不住了
当你闲逛时的表演。

21:15.517 --> 21:17.206
Hey, where you going?
嘿，你要去哪里？

21:17.310 --> 21:18.310
To my job.
为了我的工作。

21:18.344 --> 21:20.103
You have a job?
你有工作吗？

21:20.206 --> 21:21.344
Why wouldn't I?
我为什么不呢？

21:21.448 --> 21:23.172
I'm not some lazy,
inconsiderate jerk
我不是什么懒人，
不体贴的混蛋

21:23.275 --> 21:24.310
who lays in bed all day.
整天躺在床上的人。

21:24.413 --> 21:28.275
Say, where can I get
one of these jobs?
说吧，我可以去哪里
这些工作之一？

21:28.379 --> 21:29.689
Oh, they're everywhere.
哦，他们无处不在。

21:29.793 --> 21:31.896
Especially if you're green
and have six tentacles.
特别是如果你是绿色的
并有六根触手。

21:32.000 --> 21:35.965
Thanks, I'm going to go
look for one so I can stop
谢谢，我这就去
找一个这样我就可以停下来

21:36.068 --> 21:37.344
moochingoff my friends
搭讪我的朋友们

21:37.448 --> 21:40.172
and they can get back
to their lives.
他们可以回来
他们的生活。

21:40.275 --> 21:41.482
This isn't my show.
这不是我的表演。

21:41.586 --> 21:44.103
Spongebob, the remote
control's broken.
海绵宝宝，遥控器
控制坏了。

21:44.206 --> 21:45.448
Get over here and fix it.
到这里来解决它。

21:45.551 --> 21:47.034
I've got a better idea.
我有一个更好的主意。

21:47.137 --> 21:50.862
Why don't I call someone
whose jobit is to fix it?
我为什么不打电话给别人
谁的工作是修理它？

21:50.965 --> 21:52.103
You know why?
你知道为什么吗？

21:52.206 --> 21:53.482
Because when I need a jobdone
因为当我需要完成工作时

21:53.586 --> 21:59.034
I get someone with
a jobto do that job!
我找人
一份工作来做那份工作！

22:00.103 --> 22:01.310
What are you saying?
你在说什么？

22:04.379 --> 22:05.586
Donate to the children's fund?
捐给儿童基金会？

22:05.689 --> 22:08.620
Why? What have children
ever done for me?
为什么？有什么孩子
曾经为我做过吗？

22:08.724 --> 22:10.620
You want your dime back?
你想要回你的一毛钱吗？

22:10.724 --> 22:11.724
Take it.
拿走吧。

22:11.758 --> 22:13.827
Now Squidward
can come back, right?
现在章鱼哥
可以回来吧？

22:14.931 --> 22:16.965
Wrong. That ain't
my first dime.
错误的。那不是
我的第一毛钱。

22:17.068 --> 22:19.689
Then have some more dimes.
I've got plenty of them.
那就多拿点零钱吧。
我有很多。

22:19.793 --> 22:22.034
You can't put a price
on me first dime.
你无法定价
先给我一毛钱。

22:22.137 --> 22:23.551
And I can't forgive
我无法原谅

22:23.655 --> 22:25.758
that thieving bilge rat
Squidward for stealing it.
那只偷窃的舱底老鼠
章鱼哥偷了它。

22:25.862 --> 22:27.586
Listen you crustaceous
cheapskate!
听你的甲壳虫
小气鬼！

22:27.689 --> 22:29.793
Squidward's been
living at my house
driving me crazy!
章鱼哥已经
住在我家
让我发疯！

22:29.896 --> 22:31.413
And you're not going
to hire him back
而你不会去
雇用他回来

22:31.517 --> 22:34.275
all because of a stupid dime?!
都是因为一毛钱蠢事？！

22:34.379 --> 22:35.379
What's that?
那是什么？

22:36.413 --> 22:37.724
Me first dime.
我的第一毛钱。

22:37.827 --> 22:41.344
Oh, dimey! I'll never
lose you again.
哦，迪米！我永远不会
再次失去你。

22:41.448 --> 22:42.551
This is a dime?
这是一毛钱吗？

22:42.655 --> 22:44.275
I've been in business
a long time, boy.
我曾经做过生意
很长一段时间了，孩子。

22:44.379 --> 22:47.137
So... if Squidward
never stole the dime
所以...如果章鱼哥
从来没有偷过一分钱

22:47.241 --> 22:49.206
he can come back to work, right?
他可以回来工作，对吗？

22:49.310 --> 22:50.413
Aye, lad.
是的，小伙子。

22:50.517 --> 22:53.172
Just let the dime and me
have our privacy.
让我和一毛钱
有我们的隐私。

22:53.275 --> 22:55.689
Eee hoo-hoo!
哎呼呼！

22:55.793 --> 22:59.310
Well, Mr. Squidward,
it's good to have you back.
那么，章鱼哥先生，
你回来真好。

22:59.413 --> 23:02.344
Well, it's kind of good
to be back, sir.
嗯，这有点好
回来吧，先生。

23:02.448 --> 23:04.862
It's all water under
the bridge now.
下面全是水
现在的桥。

23:04.965 --> 23:06.206
I agree, sir.
我同意，先生。

23:06.310 --> 23:09.551
After all,
I'm sure you didn't mean
to misplace me dime.
毕竟，
我确定你不是这个意思
把我的一毛钱放错地方了。

23:09.655 --> 23:11.965
What? What are you saying?
什么？你在说什么？

23:12.068 --> 23:14.896
Well, it's obvious that you
put the dime in me pants.
嗯，很明显你
把一毛钱放进我的裤子里。

23:15.000 --> 23:17.689
Dimes just don't fly
into people's pants.
一毛钱不会飞
到人们的裤子里。

23:17.793 --> 23:20.620
Are you accusing me
of something?
你在指责我吗
某事？

23:20.724 --> 23:21.793
Well, the way I see it
嗯，就我看来

23:21.896 --> 23:23.344
there are three possibilities.
有三种可能性。

23:23.448 --> 23:24.848
One... you put the dime
in me pants.
一...你投入一毛钱
在我的裤子里。

23:24.931 --> 23:26.896
Two... you put the dime
in me pants.
两个...你投入一毛钱
在我的裤子里。

23:27.000 --> 23:31.620
Or three... you put the dime
in me pants!
或者三...你投入一毛钱
在我的裤子里！

